</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/0740f8e2-3302-11f1-8de6-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/AP25232257610913.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/0740f8e2-3302-11f1-8de6-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/AP25232257610913.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">92c9a41c-7a43-11f1-8ca1-59688102fe36</guid><pubDate>Tue, 07 Jul 2026 20:36:46 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/0740f8e2-3302-11f1-8de6-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/AP25232257610913.jpg">AP - Franck Robichon</source><dc:creator>法广</dc:creator></item><item><category>亚洲</category><title>越南拘捕撰写胡志明书籍的作家阮清南</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%B2/20260707-%E8%B6%8A%E5%8D%97%E6%8B%98%E6%8D%95%E6%92%B0%E5%86%99%E8%83%A1%E5%BF%97%E6%98%8E%E4%B9%A6%E7%B1%8D%E7%9A%84%E4%BD%9C%E5%AE%B6%E9%98%AE%E6%B8%85%E5%8D%97</link><description>
